msgid ""
"<br />Your LAN browsing has been successfully set up.<br /><br />Make sure "
"that the LISa server is started during the boot process. How this is done "
"depends on your distribution and OS. Usually you have to insert it somewhere "
"in a boot script under <code>/etc</code>.<br />Start the LISa server as root "
"and without any command line options.<br />The config file will now be saved "
"to <code>/etc/lisarc</code>.<br />To test the server, try <code>lan:/</code> "
"in Konqueror.<br /><br />If you have problems or suggestions, visit http://"
"lisa-home.sourceforge.net."
msgstr ""
"<br>Du hest Dien LAN-Kieker nu inricht.<br><br>Stell bitte seker, dat de "
